Package: BAGEL
Type: Package
Title: Breakpoint-based Arm-level Genomic Evaluation and Linkage
Version: 2.0.0
Author: Polly Hung <polly.hung@example.com>
Maintainer: Polly Hung <polly.hung@example.com>
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Polly", "Hung", 
      email = "polly.hung@example.com", 
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: BAGEL implements a comprehensive pipeline for breakpoint-based 
    arm-level aneuploidy detection in cancer genomics. Unlike traditional 
    methods that use fixed percentage thresholds, BAGEL uses biologically 
    meaningful chromosome arm breakpoints identified through the BISCUT 
    algorithm to define genomic regions for copy number analysis. This package
    includes pan-cancer breakpoint data and implements GISTIC-style statistical
    analysis for robust aneuploidy detection.
